Phased plan grounded in a code audit of v0.4.1, revised after review:
- Phase 1: one semantic model, two execution strategies — struct
  monomorphization for known entity/class shapes in AOT, shape-based
  Records (indexed fields, no hashmap/JSON-string round-trips) in the
  interpreter, dynamic V::Object only as fallback for untyped values
- Phase 7: builds on the existing http-framework-benchmark repo;
  remaining gaps are DB workloads, Linux runs, CI automation
- Phases 0,2-6,8-9: spec + conformance suite, monolith decomposition,
  spanned diagnostics, typed catch, data-layer and server hardening,
  security program, release gate

Quick wins shipped alongside the plan:
- ci: cargo-audit + cargo-deny workflow (non-blocking until triaged)
  with deny.toml
- readme: Performance section linking the benchmark repo and results
